    "No churn or retention data provided. SMB customers in field-service trades are among the highest-churn cohorts in vertical SaaS \u2014 businesses close, cash flow tightens, owners switch tools. Without cohort-level retention curves, I have no ability to assess true LTV. A 4-5 month CAC payback on paper becomes unsustainable if monthly churn is running above 3-4%, which is not unusual for SMB tools at early stages.",
