    "You're a two-person technical team. Who is owning commercial today \u2014 sales, customer success, and onboarding? How do you plan to build out GTM capability with this round, and what's your first commercial hire?",
    "ServiceTitan and Jobber have deep penetration in this space. What specifically do your churned customers say about the competition, and why do your won customers choose Cadence over established alternatives?"
  ],
  "diligence_requirements": [
    "Full GTM breakdown: customer acquisition channel attribution for the 120 customers, CAC by channel, and a written description of the current sales motion and who executes it.",
    "Cohort-level retention data: monthly retention curves by signup cohort for at least the past 6 months, with gross and net dollar retention figures.",
    "Churn log or summary: reasons for customer churn from at least the last 10 churned accounts, and what percentage of MRR was lost to churn in the last 3 months.",
    "Competitive win/loss data: a breakdown of deals won and lost in the last 90 days, with stated reasons, especially deals where Jobber, Housecall Pro, or ServiceTitan was the alternative considered.",
