    "Low ARPA of approximately $4,000/year for a vertical SaaS targeting SMBs creates a structural volume challenge: to generate a fund-returning outcome from a $16M pre-money entry, the business likely needs tens of thousands of paying customers or a meaningful expansion revenue motion (NDR >120%). Neither is evidenced in the materials.",
